		{"id":"4200abb71cfb60ad","type":"text","text":"Items in deze kist (Spelers mogen elk 1 kiezen):\n- 20 gold\n\n- Healing potion\n\n- Bag of holding\n\n- moonlight amulet, per 3 long rest 1x to cast the moonlight\n  \n- 2 manapotion","x":1320,"y":467,"width":328,"height":254,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"6fa6c132e3246631","type":"text","text":"De helden gaan nu naar buiten de inn, welke schoon is. De innkeeper biedt ze aan dat ze voortaan gratis kunnen verblijven in deze inn vanwege hun hulp.  Het is al heel er laat dus ze geeft de crew gelijk een sleutel van de kamer en raadt ze aan om te gaan slapen.\n\nNa het wakker worden kunnen ze naar beneden. De tavern is slecht verlicht en het ruikt er naar nat hout en oude rook.\n\nAn older man with a weathered face and a worn armor with a bloodied cloak approaches your table. You can see his sword has been heavely used and is quite damaged of all the battles he has fought.\nHis eyes flicker with a mixture of concern and weariness.\n\n\n\n","x":1920,"y":-237,"width":380,"height":497,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"26dbe630c9fa1dfe","type":"file","file":"Main Story/Story/Intro/Dialogue Tristram entree.md","x":2540,"y":-248,"width":400,"height":888,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"62879b9677d6b00d","type":"text","text":"De crew kan nu naar buiten.\n\nIn de stad zien ze nu verschillende mensen\n\n- Amazon\n- Apocathery\n- Wirt tomes and scrolls by wirt","x":3200,"y":-248,"width":360,"height":400,"color":"4"},
