		{"id":"b8ba013a86a4a59c","type":"file","file":"Main Story/Story/Quest 2 - Help the Rogue/Quest 2.4  A poopy Surprise.md","x":7536,"y":-2220,"width":440,"height":1060,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d2dd51d23010bc0b","type":"file","file":"Main Story/Story/Quest 2 - Help the Rogue/Quest 2.6 Virella's Bargain.md","x":8780,"y":-2580,"width":960,"height":2000,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"8814a3764dd7d9d5","type":"text","text":"## ⚔️ BOSS STATBLOCK: VIRELLA, WRETCHED CORE OF FLESH\n\n**Level 3 Boss Encounter** – Suited for 3–4 level 3 PCs\n\n---\n\n**VIRELLA** (Legendary Parasite)  \n_Large Aberration (Demonic), Chaotic Evil_  \n**HP** 95  \n**AC** 14 (pulsing flesh)  \n**Speed** 10 ft. (can’t move from chamber)  \n**Saving Throws** Con +5, Wis +2  \n**Damage Resistances** necrotic, poison  \n**Damage Vulnerabilities** radiant, fire  \n**Condition Immunities** charmed, frightened, prone  \n**Senses** blindsight 60 ft., tremorsense 30 ft.  \n**Languages** Infernal, Telepathy 120 ft.\n\n---\n\n### TRAITS\n\n**Fleshbound Lair.** Virella is fused with the room. She cannot leave, but controls it. _Each round, the room itself may attack._\n\n**Mind-Echo.** The first time a PC hits her with a melee weapon each round, they must succeed a DC 13 WIS save or hear their own voice whispering regrets (disadvantage on their next attack).\n\n**Digest Memory.** When a creature within 30 ft. is reduced to 0 HP, Virella _steals a memory_. That character forgets one person, place, or spell (your choice) until a Remove Curse or Rest Greater is cast.\n\n---\n\n### ACTIONS\n\n**1. Tongues of Ruin (Recharge 5-6).**  \nThree slimy tendrils lash out. Each creature of her choice within 30 ft. must succeed on a DC 14 DEX save or take 2d6 bludgeoning + 1d6 necrotic and be restrained until end of their next turn.\n\n**2. Screaming Maw (Multiattack).**  \nShe makes 2 attacks with her jaw-laced arms.\n\n- _+5 to hit, reach 10 ft., 1d8 slashing plus 1d4 psychic._\n    \n\n**3. Vomit of Ages (1/Day).**  \nSpews bile of the devoured—each creature in a 15 ft. cone makes a DC 14 CON save or takes 3d6 necrotic and is blinded for 1 round. On success: half damage, no blindness.\n\n---\n\n### LEGENDARY ACTIONS (2/turn)\n\n- **Blood Pulse (Costs 1).** Floor throbs—every non-flying creature in the room must succeed a DC 13 DEX save or be knocked prone by the pulsing meat.\n    \n- **Mocking Voice (Costs 1).** She mimics a loved one’s voice to confuse a player: DC 13 CHA save or they skip their reaction until end of next turn.\n    \n- **Summon Mouthling (Costs 2).** Vomits a crawling \"mouthling\" that attacks immediately (AC 12, HP 10, +4 to hit, 1d6 necrotic bite).\n    \n\n---\n\n### LAIR ACTIONS (Every Round at Initiative 20)\n\nRoll d4:\n\n1. **Meat Ceiling Falls** – One random PC must make DC 14 DEX save or be _pinned_ by a falling slab of sticky meat (restrained, DC 14 STR to escape).\n    \n2. **Eye Walls Open** – PCs within 15 ft. must make a WIS save DC 12 or suffer hallucinations (disadvantage on next roll).\n    \n3. **Flesh Rebirth** – Virella regains 10 HP as she absorbs the blood from the floor.\n    \n4. **Echo Shriek** – Everyone in the chamber takes 1 psychic damage and must succeed on a DC 10 WIS save or scream uncontrollably (no verbal components until end of next turn).\n    \n\n---\n\n### TACTICS:\n\n- She tries to _split the party_ with terrain, bile, and hallucinations.\n    \n- She focuses on PCs with radiant damage or high CHA.\n    \n- Her goal is **not to kill**, but to **make them give in**—she may _offer the bargain again mid-combat_ if she gains the upper hand.\n- ","x":8780,"y":-4960,"width":960,"height":2187,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"b156456449e847b3","type":"text","text":"_The cold wind tears across the burnt plain, carrying smoke and the reek of blood. After a walk of ~1 hour they see a red glow above the tree's. Maybe thats where they'll have to go.\n\n A rusted palisade wall of scavenged wood and bone looms ahead, with watchfires flickering in the dusk. It seems like theres a town ahead. trees made into poles with spikes surround the town and theres an opening with 2 guard standing next to it.","x":5765,"y":-2240,"width":400,"height":880,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cf62f58e9b9893dc","type":"text","text":"```encounter\nname: Encounter\nplayers:\n  - Lihp\n  - Misty\n  - Ava\ncreatures:\n  - \"9\": Stirge\n```","x":7700,"y":-3020,"width":440,"height":407,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"5b684e6565a36dce","type":"file","file":"Main Story/Story/Quest 2 - Help the Rogue/Quest 2.3.1 Bitchfight.md","x":6685,"y":-3016,"width":400,"height":556,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b5e83d9ea1ffe71a","type":"text","text":"### 🛡️ **Vanya Draehl, \"Iron Bitch\"** 🛡️\n\n_Medium humanoid (human), Lawful Evil_  \n**Level**: Designed for a medium-difficulty encounter against **three Level 3 players**\n\n---\n\n**Armor Class:** 16 (Scrapplate Breastplate)  \n**Hit Points:** 45 (6d8 + 18)  \n**Speed:** 30 ft.\n\n---\n\n### **Abilities**\n\n**STR** 16 (+3)  \n**DEX** 14 (+2)  \n**CON** 16 (+3)  \n**INT** 10 (+0)  \n**WIS** 12 (+1)  \n**CHA** 13 (+1)\n\n---\n\n### **Saving Throws:** STR +5, CON +5\n\n### **Skills:** Athletics +5, Intimidation +3, Perception +3\n\n### **Damage Resistances:** Slashing from non-magical weapons (repurposed armor plates)\n\n### **Languages:** Common, Blackmarch Military Cant\n\n---\n\n### **Abilities**\n\n**Tactical Presence.**  \nAll bandits within 10 feet of Vanya gain +1 to attack rolls and saving throws while she is conscious.\n\n**Second Wind (1/Day).**  \nAs a bonus action, Vanya can regain 10 HP.\n\n**Punishing Riposte (Recharge 5–6).**  \nWhen a creature misses Vanya with a melee attack, she can immediately make one melee weapon attack against them with advantage.\n\n---\n\n### **Actions**\n\n**Multiattack.**  \nVanya makes two melee attacks.\n\n**Crackjaw Mace.** _(Melee Weapon Attack)_  \n+5 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target.  \nHit: 8 (1d8 + 3) bludgeoning damage. If the target is wearing non-magical armor, it takes a −1 penalty to AC until repaired (max 1 penalty at a time).\n\n**Shield Bash.**  \n+5 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target.  \nHit: 6 (1d6 + 3) bludgeoning damage. Target must succeed on a DC 13 Strength saving throw or be knocked prone.\n\n---\n\n### **Equipment**\n\n- **Crackjaw Mace** – a brutal iron club made from broken helmets and a horse skull\n    \n- **Scrapplate Armor** – a mix of dented metal, chain links, and the painted breastplate of a fallen Askari captain\n    \n- **Bandit Signet** – a carved iron ring with the symbol of the Hollow (can be used to infiltrate or bluff lower bandits)\n    \n\n---\n\n### **Tactics**\n\n- Leads from the front, flanked by 1–2 weaker bandits (optional)\n    \n- Opens with **Shield Bash** to knock down melee threats\n    \n- Uses **Punishing Riposte** to punish missed attacks, forcing players to think before swinging\n    \n- Retreats to fight near destructible terrain (burning crates, caltrops, or blood-slick ground)\n    \n\n---\n\n### **Death Flavor**\n\nWhen defeated, Vanya collapses to one knee, spits out a tooth, and snarls:\n\n> “Heh... I told 'em you might come. Never said you’d leave.”\n\nIf searched, the players find:\n\n- A **battle map** showing **the layout of the Howling Hollow** bandit camp\n    \n- One of Moreina’s **missing spearheads**, used as a dagger\n    \n- A **letter** in military shorthand with strange orders: “Hold the gate. Delay any approach. She is watching.”","x":6685,"y":-3947,"width":451,"height":900,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"708c75cf8b3a5b7e","type":"file","file":"Main Story/Story/Intro/Intro.md","x":-1460,"y":-230,"width":400,"height":400},
