		{"id":"a8820e0eee02e271","type":"file","file":"Main Story/Story/Quest 4 - Road to Cathedral/4.1.4 - The Ossuary Vault.md","x":15300,"y":-1560,"width":520,"height":1042},
		{"id":"d0cd5fe7b8755a5e","type":"text","text":"## 🕯️ _THE IRON CRYPT_\n\n_The smell of ancient dust and rusted metal fills your lungs as your boots echo down the spiral stair. The air grows colder, not just with the bite of winter, but with the weight of something watching..._","x":13440,"y":-1560,"width":430,"height":1042},
		{"id":"6a3045943bdd2cfd","type":"text","text":"# FULL MOON LET THE BARB RAAAAAGE","x":7197,"y":-3880,"width":279,"height":220,"color":"#ff00ff"},
		{"id":"db089d5af13524c5","type":"text","text":"Last Resort ^","x":5830,"y":-4120,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#ff00ff"},
		{"id":"14a6eb1231ff0dad","type":"text","text":"```encounter\nname: Encounter\nplayers:\n  - Lihp\n  - Misty\n  - Ava\ncreatures:\n  - \"1\": Bandit Captain\n  - \"3\": Bandit\n  - \"2\": Guard\n```\n\n","x":5765,"y":-4720,"width":383,"height":407,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"8edf49d26de3ace5","type":"text","text":"# Post defeat dialogue + loot\n\n\n_Her body is pierced, broken, scorched by radiant fire and mortal will. The chamber is silent, save for the last echo of steel and spell._\n\nVirella hovers—barely—wings shattered, her face no longer terrible, but peaceful. A strange serenity wraps around her as her light flickers and wanes. She bleeds silver and shadow.\n\nHer lips part. **This time, she truly speaks.**\n\n---\n\n> _“You have done... what even Heaven dared not.”_  \n> _“But listen now. Listen well. You did not kill me.”_  \n> _(Her voice is soft, but it rumbles across bone and stone like thunder beneath the skin.)_  \n> _“Angels do not die. We fall. And fall. And fall.”_  \n> _“Until there is nothing left of who we were… and everything of what we become.”_\n\n> _“I was Virelliel. I am Virella. I will be something else still. One day.”_  \n> _(She smiles. There’s sorrow in it, but no malice. Only inevitability.)_  \n> _“You are not free of me. You only ended one verse of my song.”_\n\n---\n\n_Her wings erupt into cinders. Her skin peels into ash. Her final breath turns to a sigh of wind that extinguishes every torch, every flicker of fire in the chamber. And as her form dissolves—_\n\n_A single object remains, hovering just above the bloodstained floor._ It looks like a tome.\n","x":10020,"y":-2569,"width":840,"height":779,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"66fd565b1904b314","type":"file","file":"Main Story/Loot & Items/Loot - Tome of Tjhea.md","x":10020,"y":-1640,"width":840,"height":980,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"1a1e263cab8fde07","type":"text","text":"```encounter\nname: Encounter\nplayers:\n  - Bo\n  - Sybil\n  - Azura Nexendis\ncreatures:\n  - \"3\": Dryad\n```","x":3800,"y":2560,"width":323,"height":400,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"cc26eb543401467c","type":"text","text":"# Tristram - retun\n\n_The wind in Tristram is still. The portal snaps shut behind the party with a final _thuum_. Smoke curls from chimneys, but the streets are quiet, as if they are watching.","x":6280,"y":800,"width":250,"height":535,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"113c570da6b85417","type":"text","text":"# Mogelijkheden nodig voor als de party de dungeon uit wil en de rest **wilt** lopen naar Dark Woods","x":11302,"y":-2179,"width":680,"height":540,"color":"#ff00ff"},
		{"id":"08e64f54f1bcaabb","type":"text","text":"# Leveling potion\n\nBefore i forget, our heroes hear Quintus yell after them.\n\nI promissed you a reward for helping me, us.. Even tho my daughter will be gone forever i am a man of my word.  A few days ago i was able to get some very hard to find golden herb of a strange, but very trustworthy merchant who wanted to aid you in your mission to find king leoric.... I hope i had enough for the four of you\n\nI've made some potions for you. I would reccommend you take them right away before they rot infront of your eyes.\n\n**Hands them 4 potion vials with a bright golden glow around them.**\n\nThey should make you feel invincible, even if its just for a while.\n","x":8720,"y":1000,"width":442,"height":510,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"4e325fff9e00c37a","type":"text","text":"# Na beide Quest, Levelup -> Party LVL 4\n\nDe crew neemt de gouden potion\n\nMooie omschrijving maken dat er een gouden gloed om de spelers heen komt, ze worden een klein beetje in de lucht getild en het voelt alsof er een stoot pure energie en euforie door ze heen gaat. POEF, ze voelen zich extreem energiek en een stuk sterker... Is dit hoe een level up in Sanctuary voelt??","x":9920,"y":680,"width":840,"height":410,"color":"#ff00ff"},
		{"id":"13eee9eaaafc1baf","type":"file","file":"Main Story/Story/Quest 4 - Road to Cathedral/4.0 Road to the Cathedral.md","x":12080,"y":78,"width":520,"height":964},
