		{"id":"a9b798a6599b6a51","type":"file","file":"Main Story/Story/Quest 5 - Cathedral/5.1 Cathedral - Room 1.md","x":28720,"y":-280,"width":680,"height":919},
		{"id":"40a461c0f01f7323","x":15900,"y":-1420,"width":250,"height":188,"color":"2","type":"text","text":"- Casting Time: 1 action\n- Range: 60 feet\n- Target: A creature you can see within range\n- Components: V\n- Duration: 1 round"},
		{"id":"13caa01ee4e3f317","x":15900,"y":-1200,"width":250,"height":109,"type":"text","text":"Cursed\n\nelke dag DC13 roll\n"},
		{"id":"c2a4b01d57960f18","x":15435,"y":-2213,"width":250,"height":393,"type":"text","text":"## Forgotten King (Weakened Aspect)\n\n_Medium undead, lawful evil_\n\n**Armor Class** 15 (rusted armor)  \n**Hit Points** 84 (12d8 + 24)  \n**Speed** 30 ft.\n\n|STR|DEX|CON|INT|WIS|CHA|\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|16 (+3)|10 (+0)|14 (+2)|12 (+1)|12 (+1)|15 (+2)|\n\n**Saving Throws** Con +4, Wis +3  \n**Skills** Intimidation +4, History +3  \n**Damage Resistances** necrotic, cold; bludgeoning/piercing/slashing from nonmagical weapons  \n**Damage Immunities** poison  \n**Condition Immunities** charmed, frightened, poisoned  \n**Senses** darkvision 60 ft., passive Perception 11  \n**Languages** Common, Infernal  \n**Challenge** 4 (1,100 XP)  \n**Proficiency Bonus** +2\n\n---\n\n### Traits\n\n**Aura of Dread.** Any creature of the King’s choice that starts its turn within 10 feet must succeed on a DC 12 Wisdom saving throw or be frightened until the start of its next turn.\n\n**Undying Will (1/Day).** When reduced to 0 hit points, the King drops to 1 hit point instead.\n\n---\n\n### Actions\n\n**Multiattack.** The King makes two _Spectral Blade_ attacks.\n\n**Spectral Blade.** _Melee Weapon Attack:_ +5 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. _Hit:_ 10 (2d6 + 3) slashing damage plus 4 (1d8) necrotic damage.\n\n**Soul Drain (Recharge 6).** The King targets one creature within 15 feet. That creature must make a DC 13 Constitution saving throw or take 14 (4d6) necrotic damage, and the King regains hit points equal to half the damage dealt.\n\n**Raise Fallen (1/Day).** The King summons 1d2 skeletons or zombies under his command in unoccupied spaces within 15 feet."},
		{"id":"b78fbb73f1f2b6a2","type":"file","file":"Main Story/Story/Quest 3 - Help the Appocathary/Apothecary 3.5.md","x":6885,"y":664,"width":675,"height":1952,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d5e9ef84aa06e0fd","type":"text","text":"Dear heroes, lest i forget, \nAlong the road you will find a effigy that needs to be fed.\n\n_\"The effigy feeds on fear and flame,_  \nA whisper carved, a cursed name._  \nBut ink can bind what blood has marred,_  \nA page once penned shall strike it hard._  \nSo place the tale where roots have spread,_  \nAnd still the screams of restless dead.\"_\n\n_(holding out the fragment)_\n\n> _\"A page I stole, from pain and pyre,_  \n> Torn from thoughts that danced with fire._  \n> Her tale is inked in sorrow’s thread—_  \n> _A girl long gone, but not yet dead._  \n> Take it now, and tread with grace,_  \n> Or wrath shall haunt this cursed place.\"_\n\nThe journal fragment smells faintly of smoke and mold. It’s written in a childlike scrawl, water-stained and singed at the edges. The final lines read:\n\n> _\"They said the trees would keep me safe.  \n> But Mother said the woods don't forget.\"_\n\n\n","x":16280,"y":680,"width":460,"height":780,"color":"2"}
	],
